      "Nobody spoke until they were back beneath three layers of copper mesh in the Tenderloin basement.",
      "Sam sat on the bottom step of the concrete stairs, her knees pulled tight to her chest, watching Orpheus wrap a fresh strip of electrical tape around a cracked insulator on his antenna rig. Her ears were still ringing from the implosion on the platform, a dull, underwater roar that made the bunker feel smaller than ever.",
