      "By 5:00 AM, the bunker was in full mobilization.",
      "Sam sat in a metal chair in the center of the room with two copper grounding clips attached to her earlobes, her eyes half-closed as her vision flickered between the basement and a terrifying, first-person overlay of green phosphor wireframe lines. Whatever the entity was doing up on Mount Sutro, Sam was seeing its blueprint in real time.",
      "\"It’s hijacking the high-gain master antennas at the nine-hundred-foot level,\" Sam said, her voice tight as she read the glowing green schematics burning behind her eyelids. \"The street Carriers have formed a continuous induction loop around the base of the mountain on Clarendon and Twin Peaks Boulevard. In twenty minutes, the main capacitor banks in the tower vault are going to hit full charge.\"",
