      "Here inside the belly of the array, the air was freezing cold, and the walls were sweating a thin film of black, static-charged condensation. As they moved deeper down the central corridor toward the maintenance elevator shaft that led up into the tower's central leg, the overhead PA speakers bolted to the concrete corners clicked on with a loud pop.",
