      "\"It’s scraping our synaptic tracks!\" Fourfootyest snarled over his vocoder, his red eye darting wildly up at the ceiling conduits as he cranked the gain on his chest jammer to maximum. \"You're inside the recording head! It’s playing your own ghosts back at you to slow you down—keep moving toward the stairwell!\"",
