      "The iron grating beneath Orpheus’s boots liquefied into static. He lunged back into the side doorway of an auxiliary relay closet to avoid falling through the floor, and at that exact second, the steel fire door between the landing and the corridor slammed shut on its own, its metal frame warping and fusing into the cinderblock wall in a shower of violet sparks.",
