      "Two inches from her face, the three fused skulls tilted in unison, the brass tape heads inside its jaw spinning to a precise 7.5 inches per second. And when the sound came out of its throat, it wasn't the voices of the dead 1977 engineers.",
      "Layered beneath fifty years of crushing tectonic static, clear and warm and inescapable, was the voice of Elena Lopez:",
      "\"WELCOME HOME, SAMANTHA. THE FREE PREVIEW IS OVER. YOUR SIGNAL IS OURS.\" The vacuum tubes in the creature’s eyes flared blinding white, the static swallowed the lens of the room, and everything cut to pitch black."
