      "At the top of the ridge, Fourfootyest wedged his compact body between the base of the steel repeater pole and the marine battery, clamped his good left steel claw around the positive lead, and bit down hard on the negative copper braid with his canine fangs.",
      "*KRA-KOOM.*",
      "A massive dome of blinding amber-and-gold counter-frequency light erupted from the top of the repeater pole, accompanied by the loudest, dirtiest, most obnoxious blast of heavy-metal guitar feedback mixed with a roaring canine bark that had ever echoed across the Golden Gate Strait.",
      "Down on the switchbacks of the coastal trail, all five hundred Carriers froze mid-step.",
